<div class="heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SAO · ACTIVITY RECORDS</p><h1><%= event.name %></h1><p><%= event.category %> · <%= new Date(event.date).toLocaleString('en-GB',{timeZone:'Asia/Hong_Kong'}) %> HKT<%= event.removed?' · Event removed':'' %></p></div><a href="/admin">← SAO dashboard</a></div>
<% if(updated){ %><p class="success" role="status">Activity records updated.</p><% } %>
<div class="card"><h2>Add a student record</h2><p>SAO can add a record after the registration deadline. For an activity that has started, choose Completed to count its engagement hours towards the student's progress.</p>
<form method="post" action="/admin/events/<%= event._id %>/records" class="filters"><label>Student<select name="student" required><option value="">Select a student</option><% students.forEach(s=>{ %><option value="<%= s._id %>"><%= s.name %> · <%= s.email %></option><% }) %></select></label><label>Status<select name="status" required><% ['pending','confirmed','waitlisted','completed','cancelled'].forEach(s=>{ %><option value="<%= s %>" <%= s===(new Date(event.date)<=new Date()?'completed':'pending')?'selected':'' %>><%= s[0].toUpperCase()+s.slice(1) %></option><% }) %></select></label><button>Add record</button></form><p>Completed records for past activities may be added even when capacity is full. If a student has a cancelled record, adding them again updates that record.</p></div>
<h2>Student records (<%= records.length %>)</h2><div class="card"><% if(!records.length){ %><p>No student records for this activity yet.</p><% } %><% records.forEach(r=>{ %><div class="row record-row"><div><strong><%= r.student?.name || 'Student unavailable' %></strong><p><%= r.student?.email || '' %> · Registered <%= new Date(r.createdAt).toLocaleDateString('en-GB',{timeZone:'Asia/Hong_Kong'}) %></p></div><form class="record-edit" method="post" action="/admin/records/<%= r._id %>"><input type="hidden" name="returnToEvent" value="1"><label>Status for <%= r.student?.name || 'student' %><select name="status"><% ['pending','confirmed','waitlisted','completed','cancelled'].forEach(s=>{ %><option value="<%= s %>" <%= r.status===s?'selected':'' %>><%= s[0].toUpperCase()+s.slice(1) %></option><% }) %></select></label><button>Save</button></form><form method="post" action="/admin/events/<%= event._id %>/records/<%= r._id %>/delete" onsubmit="return confirm('Delete this student record? Completed hours will be removed from the student’s progress.')"><button type="submit" class="secondary">Delete</button></form></div><% }) %></div>
